      "html": "† III. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָמוֹן</span></big>  <strong>s.pr.m. (</strong><em>mestre de obras</em><strong>)</strong> (<em>a</em>) rei de Judá <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.18\">2 K 21:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:19\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:24\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.25\">25</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.14\">1 Ch 3:14</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.20\">2 Ch 33:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:23\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.23\">23</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.25\">25</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.2\">Je 1:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.3\">25:3</a>; (<em>b</em>) comandante de uma cidade <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.26\">1 K 22:26</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.25\">2 Ch 18:25</a>; (<em>c</em>) um dos descendentes dos servos de Salomão <span class=\"bdbh-pt-unresolved-xref\" role=\"note\" data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:58\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/Nehemiah.7.58\" title=\"O atributo de destino cita Ne 7.58, mas o rótulo inglês visível indica Ne 7.59; destino não certificado sem cotejo material.\">Ne 7.59 (destino suspenso)</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">אָמִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:57\" href=\"/Ezra.2.57\">Ezr 2:57</a>.",
