      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אֵמֶר</span>], <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹמֶר</span></big>  <strong>s.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77\" href=\"/Psalms.77\">ψ 77</a>, <span class=\"bdbh-pt-unresolved-xref\" role=\"note\" data-ref=\"Psalms 9\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/Psalms.9\" title=\"Após o rótulo ψ 77 (capítulo), o segmento 9 foi ligado digitalmente a Psalms 9 (capítulo), embora a indicação pareça ψ 77.9; suspenso sem reconstrução do destino.\">9 (referência suspensa)</span> fala, palavra, somente no uso poético; e <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:27\" href=\"/Joshua.24.27\">Jos 24:27</a> em estilo elevado; — forma absoluta <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:28\" href=\"/Job.22.28\">Jb 22:28</a> + 5 ocorrências; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אִמְרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:29\" href=\"/Job.20.29\">Jb 20:29</a>; plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.7\">Pr 19:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.21\">22:21</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אִמְרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:4\" href=\"/Numbers.24.4\">Nu 24:4</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמָרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:22\" href=\"/Job.22.22\">Jb 22:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אִמְרֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 32:14\" href=\"/Job.32.14\">Jb 32:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.26\">Is 41:26</a> (sobre a derivação de <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹמֶר</span> cf. Di <a data-ref=\"Job 33:33\" href=\"/Job.33.33\">Jb 33:33</a>) etc.; —<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>enunciado, palavra</em>, especialmente no plural <a data-ref=\"Job 6:26\" href=\"/Job.6.26\">Jb. 6:26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלִּים</span>) <a data-ref=\"Job 32:12\" href=\"/Job.32.12\">32:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 32:14\" href=\"/Job.32.14\">14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלִּין</span>) <a data-ref=\"Job 33:3\" href=\"/Job.33.3\">33:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 34:37\" href=\"/Job.34.37\">34:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 5:2\" href=\"/Psalms.5.2\">ψ 5:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הָגִיג</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:6\" href=\"/Psalms.141.6\">141:6</a> (sobre esse versículo, cf. Che); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.1\">Pr 2:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְוָה</span>), v. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.16\">16</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.10\">4:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.20\">20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּבָר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.1\">7:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְוָה</span>), v. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.7\">19:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.26\">Is 41:26</a>; palavras de Deus <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:4\" href=\"/Numbers.24.4\">Nu 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:16\" href=\"/Numbers.24.16\">16</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:27\" href=\"/Joshua.24.27\">Jos 24:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 6:10\" href=\"/Job.6.10\">Jb 6:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 22:22\" href=\"/Job.22.22\">22:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:11\" href=\"/Psalms.107.11\">ψ 107:11</a>; figuradamente, do dia <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:3\" href=\"/Psalms.19.3\">ψ 19:3</a> (singular); cf. v. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:4\" href=\"/Psalms.19.4\">4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבָרִים</span>) mas ver Che sobre esse versículo; da sabedoria personificada <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.21\">Pr 1:21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל</span>); frequente na expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">אִמְרֵי־פִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.1\">Dt 32:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:15\" href=\"/Psalms.19.15\">ψ 19:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶגְיוֹן</span>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 54:4\" href=\"/Psalms.54.4\">54:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפִלָּה</span>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:1\" href=\"/Psalms.78.1\">78:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹרָה</span>); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.4.5\">Pr 4:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.7\">5:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.24\">7:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.8\">8:8</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 8:2\" href=\"/Job.8.2\">Jb 8:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.2\">Pr 6:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 23:12\" href=\"/Job.23.12\">Jb 23:12</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְוַת שְׂפָתָיו</span>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 138:4\" href=\"/Psalms.138.4\">ψ 138:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 6:5\" href=\"/Hosea.6.5\">Ho 6:5</a> (das palavras de YHWH como arma); nas expressões <span dir=\"rtl\">אִמְרֵיישֶׁר</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:25\" href=\"/Job.6.25\">Jb 6:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ בִינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.2\">Pr 1:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ נֹעַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.26\">Pr 15:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.24\">16:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ דָ֑עַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.27\">19:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.12\">23:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ אֱמֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.21\">22:21</a>, cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אֱמֶת²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱמֶת²\">הֵשִׁיב אֲמָרִים אֱמֶת</a> v. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.21\">21</a> <em>dar resposta;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּשִׁיב אֲמָרֶיהָ לָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:29\" href=\"/Judges.5.29\">Ju 5:29</a> <em>ela responde</em> (isto é, <em>repete</em>) <em>suas palavras a si mesma;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">חָשַׂךְ א׳</span> <em>poupar</em> (isto é, abster-se de) <em>palavras</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.27\">Pr 17:27</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  singular <em>promessa</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:9\" href=\"/Psalms.77.9\">ψ 77:9</a>; <em>determinação, decreto</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:29\" href=\"/Job.20.29\">Jb 20:29</a>; <em>ordem</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:12\" href=\"/Psalms.68.12\">ψ 68:12</a> (mas ver Che); <em>plano, propósito</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:28\" href=\"/Job.22.28\">Jb 22:28</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזַר־א׳</span>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:9\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.9\">Hb 3:9</a> Thes <em>juradas estão as varas do decreto</em> (isto é, os castigos decretados), mas a passagem é duvidosa; ver comentários; —<a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:21\" href=\"/Genesis.49.21\">Gn 49:21</a> leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמִרֵי</span> cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, אָמִיר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_אָמִיר\">אָמִיר</a>; ver Di",
