      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַרְיָ֫הוּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲמַרְיָה</span></big>  <strong>s.pr.m. (</strong><em>Yah</em>(<em>u</em>) <em>prometeu</em>, cf. palmireno <span dir=\"rtl\">אמרשמשא</span>, sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">יתעאמר</span><strong>)</strong>; a forma longa ocorre somente em <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.23\">1 Ch 24:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 19:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.19.11\">2 Ch 19:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.15\">31:15</a>.<br><strong>1.</strong>  um levita <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.19\">1 Ch 23:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.23\">24:23</a> (no tempo de Davi), cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.33\">1 Ch 5:33</a>,<sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.37\">6:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:3\" href=\"/Ezra.7.3\">Ezr 7:3</a>; ver também <br><strong>2.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.37\">1 Ch 5:37</a>,<sup>(×2)</sup>; também <br><strong>3.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:42\" href=\"/Ezra.10.42\">Ezr 10:42</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  sacerdote principal no reinado de Josafá <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 19:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.19.11\">2 Ch 19:11</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  levita no reinado de Ezequias <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.15\">2 Ch 31:15</a>.<br><strong>6.</strong>  filho de Ezequias e bisavô de Sofonias <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:1\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.1\">Zp 1:1</a>.<br><strong>7.</strong>  um sacerdote <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.4\">Ne 10:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.2\">12:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.13\">13</a>.<br><strong>8.</strong>  um homem de Judá <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.4\">Ne 11:4</a>.",
